    {
      "name": "http-cookies",
      "version": "2.0.1",
      "root": "http_cookies",
      "summary": "`__Host-` prefixed browser session cookies for constrained Ferrite apps. Browsers enforce the `__Host-` prefix, `Path=/`, `Secure`, and the absence of `Domain` together, and silently drop any cookie that fails one of those rules instead of rejecting it visibly. This package sets them in one constructor, reads them back under the same prefixed name, and re-checks the invariant against the rendered `Set-Cookie` header that the browser actually parses.",
