    {
      "name": "http-query",
      "version": "1.0.1",
      "root": "http_query",
      "summary": "A total query-string decoder for constrained Ferrite apps. Deployable Ferrite apps read `IngressRequest.path`, which carries `path?query` verbatim, so each app decodes query strings itself. Applications previously accumulated eight hand-rolled decoders that disagreed on `+`, `%2F`, pairs without `=`, and whether parameter names are decoded at all. This package consolidates them into one implementation whose contract is an edge-case table executed row by row by `parse_query_decodes_every_edge`.",
